origin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/27c44b40c9a8f8d8a89b512bf971d10b.poster.avif?t=1788241867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/27c44b40c9a8f8d8a89b512bf971d10b.webm?t=1788241867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTING &amp; GHOUL HUNTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest herbs, hunt animals, gather mutants’ body parts. Brew serums, cook food, upgrade weapons, repair gears. The Zone is perilous — but also full of riches for the cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/f636838b7e9a49f7b6514dc0643cf8fd.poster.avif?t=1788241867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/f636838b7e9a49f7b6514dc0643cf8fd.webm?t=1788241867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION &amp; LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravaged villages, toxic swamps, abandoned Soviet bunkers—each environment holds clues, journals, side-quests, and mysteries born of the 1908 Tunguska Event. Uncover the hidden stories at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/f04d21b008362f4a7ae0a717e981c048.poster.avif?t=1788241867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601970/extras/f04d21b008362f4a7ae0a717e981c048.webm?t=1788241867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"b